.TH ATVV-MCP 1 "2026-10-30" "atvv-linux 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
atvv-mcp \- stdio MCP server for the ATVV daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B atvv-mcp
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B atvv-mcp
serves the Model Context Protocol over stdin/stdout and connects to
.B org.atvv.Daemon
on the session bus. It never handles audio; use the resident
.B Audio/Source
for capture.
.PP
The server supports the MCP revisions 2024-11-05 through 2025-11-25 and the
tools
.BR status ,
.BR voice_start ,
.BR voice_stop ,
.BR voice_toggle ,
.BR list_devices ,
and
.BR reload .
A backend failure is returned as a tool result with
.BR isError ;
an unknown tool is a JSON-RPC error.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS
Session bus used to reach
.BR org.atvv.Daemon .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR atvvd (1),
.BR atvvctl (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Yangtse Su
